  "section": "14",
  "quote": "A provision in a tenancy agreement prohibiting the presence of animals in or about the residential complex is void.",
  "reason": "Section 14 only voids provisions that prohibit the presence of animals in or about the residential complex. Because this clause does not ban pets and only establishes reasonable rules for pet control and cleanliness in the common areas, it does not conflict with the Act and is permitted."
}

